    "example": "例子：全新的外观与操作感让使用更加舒适。",
    "context": "With its gorgeous, resizable interface, optional level display, knee display and side-chain EQ controller, it can either take the form of a classic, straightforward analog compressor, or present itself as a modern allround compressor with extensive metering and controls. It's up to you! Of course, apart from the new look and feel, we've also added many often-requested new features. Most importantly, FabFilter Pro-C 2 introduces five brand new compression styles, in addition to the three original v1 styles.",
    "contextZh": "凭借其华丽的、可调整大小的界面，可选的音量电平显示、拐点显示和侧链均衡控制器，它既可以呈现为经典的、简洁的模拟压缩器形态，也可以展现为具有丰富计量显示和控制项的现代全能压缩器。完全由你决定！当然，除了全新的外观与操作感之外，我们还新增了许多用户经常要求的功能。最重要的是，FabFilter Pro-C 2 在原有的三种 v1 压缩风格之外，还引入了五种全新的压缩风格。",
    "category": "其他",
