    "context": "Both versions will co-exist and can both be used at the same time. This ensures that you can open old songs that use Pro-C 1 without problems! FabFilter Pro-C 2 opens presets from Pro-C 1 without problems, but note that the resulting sound can be different, because of fundamental changes and improvements in Pro-C 2. See Upgrading to Pro-C 2 for more information. FabFilter Pro-C 2 is available in VST, VST3, AU (Audio Units), AAX Native and AudioSuite formats (all both 64-bit and 32-bit), as well as RTAS (32-bit only), for Mac OS X and Windows.",
