    "word": "MIDI",
    "ipa": "ˈmɪdi",
    "translit": "",
    "zh": "乐器数字接口",
    "def": "一种用于电子乐器、计算机和音频设备之间传输演奏控制信息的通信协议。",
    "example": "例子：用 MIDI 键盘弹奏一个音符时，键盘发送音高、力度等信息给软件合成器发声。",
    "context": "If MIDI is enabled, the compressor is triggered when you hit any key on a connected MIDI keyboard controller. Highly improved level meters, with peak and loudness level visualization. The loudness level complies with the Momentary mode of the EBU R128 / ITU-R 1770 standards. Introducing Retina support on OS X and High DPI support on Windows. Upgrading to Pro-C 2 Upgrading from Pro-C version 1 to the new Pro-C 2 is safe and easy: installing Pro-C 2 will not replace or delete the previous Pro-C 1 plug-in.",
    "contextZh": "如果启用了 MIDI，当你敲击已连接的 MIDI 键盘控制器上的任意琴键时，压缩器就会被触发。电平表经过大幅改进，具备峰值和响度级的可视化显示。响度级符合 EBU R128 / ITU-R 1770 标准的瞬时模式。在 OS X 上引入 Retina 支持，在 Windows 上引入高 DPI 支持。升级到 Pro-C 2：从 Pro-C 第一版升级到新的 Pro-C 2 既安全又简单：安装 Pro-C 2 不会替换或删除之前的 Pro-C 1 插件。",
