    "context": "Pro-C 2 offers 8 different styles, all with their own characteristics: Clean - An allround, low distortion, feedforward, program dependent style (originally from Pro-C v1). Classic - A vintage, feedback, very program dependent style (originally from Pro-C v1). Opto - A relatively slow, very soft knee, more linear opto style (originally from Pro-C v1), Vocal - A very effective algorithm to bring vocals to the front of your mix. It works with automatic knee and ratio settings, so compressing your lead vocal is as easy as choosing the right threshold.",
