    "word": "latency",
    "ipa": "ˈleɪtənsi",
    "translit": "",
    "zh": "延迟",
    "def": "信号经过处理后相对于原始信号产生的时间滞后。",
    "example": "例子：开启前瞻后，音频输出会比输入晚几毫秒，这就是额外的延迟。",
    "context": "Because lookahead causes additional latency, it can be globally enabled or disabled in the bottom bar. The Hold slider sets the time with which peaks in gain reduction will be prolonged. Applying a bit of hold time can help increase the transparency of gain reduction. With longer hold times, you can achieve nice pumping effects. The Wet Gain knob adjusts the gain of the signal after it has been compressed. This is also known as make-up gain because it compensates for the gain reduction introduced by the compressor.",
    "contextZh": "由于前瞻会引入额外的延迟，因此可以在底部栏中全局启用或禁用它。保持滑块设定增益衰减峰值被延长的时间。应用少量保持时间有助于提升增益衰减的透明感。使用较长的保持时间，可以获得漂亮的抽吸效果。湿声增益旋钮用于调节信号经过压缩后的增益。这也被称为补偿增益，因为它弥补了压缩器引入的增益衰减。",
