    "example": "例子：在插件界面上，Wet Gain 旋钮外圈的圆环就是 pan ring。",
    "context": "The pan ring around the Wet Gain knob controls the balance between mid and side. This can be especially useful when applying make-up gain after mid-only or side-only compression. When Auto Gain is enabled (using the AUTO button next to GAIN), automatic make-up gain is applied to the processed signal, depending on current settings for Threshold, Ratio, Knee and Attack. Auto Gain helps you to keep the audible audio level the same while adjusting the controls. The Auto Gain algorithm is aware of mid-only or side-only processing.",
    "contextZh": "Wet Gain 旋钮外圈的声像环控制中置与侧向之间的平衡。在对仅中置或仅侧向压缩后施加补偿增益时，这尤其有用。当启用 Auto Gain（使用 GAIN 旁边的 AUTO 按钮）时，会根据当前的 Threshold、Ratio、Knee 和 Attack 设置，自动对处理后的信号施加补偿增益。Auto Gain 有助于你在调节各项控制时保持可听音频电平不变。Auto Gain 算法能识别仅中置或仅侧向的处理。",
    "category": "其他",
    "source": "小赫转存",
    "id": 611
