    "context": "It offers a fixed number of bands: a low cut filter, a high cut filter and one additional \"Mid\" band in the center, which is fully customizable. Note that the Mid band is in Auto Mode by default. This makes it a Bell curve with automatically chosen frequency, gain and Q settings. It's placed in between the low and high cut filters. When these are enabled, it will accentuate the center frequency when the range gets very narrow. This makes it a lot easier to trigger on very specific frequencies.",
    "contextZh": "它提供固定数量的频段：一个低切滤波器、一个高切滤波器，以及中间一个额外的\"中频\"频段，该频段完全可自定义。注意，中频段默认处于自动模式。这使它成为一条钟形曲线，频率、增益和 Q 值均自动选定。它位于低切和高切滤波器之间。当这些滤波器启用时，如果范围变得非常窄，它会突出中心频率。这使得在非常特定的频率上进行触发变得容易得多。",
    "category": "合成器",
