    "translit": "",
    "zh": "增益变化",
    "def": "指音频信号在处理过程中增益（音量）的增加或减少量。",
    "example": "例子：施加 -6 dB 的增益变化意味着信号被衰减了 6 分贝。",
    "context": "The level display visualizes the input and output level, together with the applied gain change. The input is shown in dark grey, whil the output is light grey with a light stroke, which makes it easy to see the exact effects of the applied gain reduction. The gain reduction itself is shown as a red line. Using the Display button (right above the Style button in the compression controls panel), you can hide or show the level display. Hiding it will also hide the knee display and changes the vertical level meters to larger horizontal ones.",
    "contextZh": "电平显示将输入和输出电平以及所施加的增益变化可视化。输入以深灰色显示，而输出以浅灰色并带有浅色描边显示，这样可以轻松看到所施加增益衰减的确切效果。增益衰减本身以红色线条显示。使用显示按钮（位于压缩控制面板中样式按钮的正上方），您可以隐藏或显示电平显示。隐藏它也会隐藏拐点显示，并将垂直电平表变为更大的水平电平表。",
