    "context": "This way, Pro-C 2 looks and feels more like a traditional compressor. Once you've chosen to show/hide the dislay, new instances of the plug-in will always open this way. Peak level and loudness level metering At the right of the interface, there are three accurate peak level meters that display the current input, gain reduction and output levels. The read-outs above the level meters show the highest measured peak value, until you click on them. Aditionally, the input and output meters also show the loudness level (per channel) on top of the peak level.",
