    "translit": "",
    "zh": "旁通 / 旁路",
    "def": "暂时关闭效果处理，让信号原样通过的开关。",
    "example": "例子：按下旁通后，压缩器不再起作用，声音恢复未处理状态。",
    "context": "At the right bottom of the interface, you'll find the bypass, mix, input level and output level controls, all accessed via a single output button. As soon as you hover the mouse above the output button, a panel will pop up, giving you access to the following settings: The Input Level/Pan knob at the left adjusts the level and L/R panning of the input signal before any processing is applied. You can use this as an alternative to changing the threshold. The Output Level/Pan knob at the right adjusts the level and L/R panning of the final output signal.",
    "contextZh": "在界面的右下方，你会找到旁通、混合比例、输入电平和输出电平控件，它们都通过一个输出按钮来访问。只要将鼠标悬停在输出按钮上方，就会弹出一个面板，让你访问以下设置：左侧的输入电平/声像旋钮用于在任何处理应用之前调节输入信号的电平和左右声像。你可以用它作为更改阈值的替代方式。右侧的输出电平/声像旋钮用于调节最终输出信号的电平和左右声像。",
