    "def": "指示用户在软件界面上点击或触碰想要分配 MIDI 控制的目标参数控件。",
    "example": "例子：在合成器界面上点击滤波器的截止频率旋钮。",
    "context": "Touch the control of the desired parameter in the interface that you wish to control. A red square will mark the chosen parameter. 2. Adjust the slider or knob on your MIDI keyboard or MIDI controller that you want to associate with that parameter. That's it! The parameter will now be controlled with the MIDI controller. You can now go back to step 1 to associate a different parameter. Note that there is no warning when you associate a different knob with a controller number that is already used. It will just be replaced.",
    "contextZh": "触摸界面中你想要控制的所需参数的控件。一个红色方块将标记所选参数。2. 调节你希望与该参数关联的 MIDI 键盘或 MIDI 控制器上的滑块或旋钮。就这样！该参数现在将由 MIDI 控制器控制。你现在可以回到第 1 步来关联另一个参数。请注意，当你将一个不同的旋钮关联到已被使用的控制器编号时，不会有任何警告。它只会被替换。",
