    "context": "Revert Reverts to the last saved MIDI mapping (or the state when the plug-in was started). Save Saves the current MIDI mapping so Revert will go back to this state. The current mapping is automatically saved when closing the plug-in. Routing MIDI to effect plug-ins For MIDI Learn to work properly, the plug-in need to actually receive MIDI of course. Depending on your host, it can be quite difficult to route MIDI data to effect plug-ins.",
