    "context": "From the 'MIDI from' drop down menu, choose your MIDI device (if not already selected). Then, in the 'MIDI to' drop down menu, choose the Audio track that has FabFilter Pro-C 2 on it. NOTE: only the first plug-in on any track can receive MIDI! Tips Compression is also triggered by MIDI notes. If at least one note is on, the compressor behaves as if a 0 dB signal is entering the side chain at this moment, so it is strongly triggered. The Disable/Enable MIDI option in the MIDI Learn menu turns this off as well.",
    "contextZh": "在「MIDI 来源」下拉菜单中，选择你的 MIDI 设备（如果尚未选择）。然后，在「MIDI 目标」下拉菜单中，选择加载了 FabFilter Pro-C 2 的音频轨道。注意：只有每条轨道上的第一个插件才能接收 MIDI！提示：压缩也可以由 MIDI 音符触发。如果至少有一个音符处于开启状态，压缩器会表现得好像此时有一个 0 dB 的信号进入侧链，因此会被强烈触发。MIDI 学习菜单中的「禁用/启用 MIDI」选项也可以关闭此功能。",
    "category": "其他",
    "source": "小赫转存",
