    "date": "2026-09-24",
    "text": "There is one signal-processing tool that is almost impossible to do without in any form of audio recording or postproduction: compression. Compression is available in a wide variety of different formats, flavors, designs and degrees of quirkiness. FabFilter Pro-C 2 is not just a good sounding compressor. FabFilter Pro-C 2 is a superb stereo compressor with all the tricks up its sleeve that you will ever need.",
