    "date": "2026-09-24",
    "text": "Introducing Range setting, which limits the maximum applied gain change. Introducing Mix, which scales the gain change from 0% to 200%. Introducing up to 4x Oversampling. Simplified and improved side-chain stereo handling, introducing variable stereo linking with mid-only, side-only, M>S and S>M processing. Introducing side-chain EQ section, with customizable HP and LP filters, plus an additional freely adjustable sidechain filter (Bell, Low Shelf, High Shelf, Band Pass, Notch or Tilt).",
    "translation": "推出范围设置，用于限制最大施加的增益变化量。推出混合比例，可将增益变化从 0% 缩放到 200%。推出最高 4 倍过采样。简化和改进的侧链立体声处理，推出可变立体声链接，支持仅中置、仅两侧、中置转两侧和两侧转中置处理。推出侧链均衡器部分，具有可自定义的高通和低通滤波器，外加一个可自由调节的侧链滤波器（钟形、低架、高架、带通、陷波或倾斜）。",
