    "date": "2026-09-24",
    "text": "To use the MIDI features in Pro-C 2, create a new MIDI track and set its output to the Pro-C 2 instance you have just created. (The VST 3 version of Pro-C 2 can be found in the Dynamics section.) Logic Pro Choose an empty insert slot on one of your audio tracks, instrument tracks or buses and select FabFilter Pro-C 2 from the pop-up menu. You will find FabFilter Pro-C 2 in the Audio Units > FabFilter section (named FF Pro-C 2).",
