    "text": "Ableton Live In Session view, select the track you would like to place FabFilter Pro-C 2 on, for example by clicking the track name. At the left top of Ableton Live's interface, click on the Plug-in Device Browser icon (third icon from the top). From the plug-ins list, double-click FabFilter/FabFilter Pro-C 2, or drag it onto the track. Pro Tools Choose an empty insert slot on one of your audio tracks, instrument tracks or buses and select FabFilter Pro-C 2 from the pop-up menu in the Dynamics section.",
