    "text": "For example, bass or lead vocals are often placed in the center of the stereo image, so only processing the mid-signal will leave all stereo content untouched, ensuring the most transparent end result possible. To better understand the working of these settings, enable the Audition button. You can now directly hear the effect of stereo linking and mid-only or side-only processing! Side chain EQ controller The large interactive EQ controller takes up most of the side chain section, and enables you to easily adjust the side chain filtering.",
