    "text": "If you right-click on the dot for an EQ band, a pop-up menu appears with various band settings. This is a quick way to modify the EQ band while you're working in the display. Tips The Stereo Link slider is of course only enabled in the stereo version of FabFilter Pro-C 2. In Full Screen mode, available via the button at the right top of the interface, Pro-C 2 will fill the whole screen, making the side chain EQ controller much larger as well, so you can make very precise adjustements. See Full Screen mode and resizing.",
