    "date": "2026-09-24",
    "text": "Hold down Ctrl+Alt (Command+Alt on Mac OS X) and click the dot of the customizable Mid band to change its shape. Hold down Alt+Shift and click the dot of the low or high cut filter once to change its slope. Double-click a dot to enter values in the parameter value display (using the Tab key to step through Frequency, Gain and Q) or double-click the values in the parameter value display directly. Note that you can enter frequencies in various ways, like \"100\", \"2k\", \"A4\" or \"C#2+13\".",
    "translation": "按住 Ctrl+Alt（在 Mac OS X 上为 Command+Alt）并点击可自定义中频频段的圆点以改变其形状。按住 Alt+Shift 并点击低切或高切滤波器的圆点一次以改变其斜率。双击一个圆点以在参数值显示区中输入数值（使用 Tab 键依次切换频率、增益和 Q 值），或直接双击参数值显示区中的数值。请注意，你可以用多种方式输入频率，例如 \"100\"、\"2k\"、\"A4\" 或 \"C#2+13\"。",
