    "text": "This way, Pro-C 2 looks and feels more like a traditional compressor. Once you've chosen to show/hide the dislay, new instances of the plug-in will always open this way. Peak level and loudness level metering At the right of the interface, there are three accurate peak level meters that display the current input, gain reduction and output levels. The read-outs above the level meters show the highest measured peak value, until you click on them. Aditionally, the input and output meters also show the loudness level (per channel) on top of the peak level.",
    "translation": "这样，Pro-C 2 的外观和感觉就更像一台传统压缩器了。一旦你选择了显示或隐藏显示界面，插件的新实例将始终以这种方式打开。峰值电平和响度电平计量：在界面右侧，有三个精确的峰值电平表，分别显示当前的输入、增益衰减和输出电平。电平表上方的读数会显示测得的最高峰值，直到你点击它们为止。此外，输入和输出表还在峰值电平之上显示了（每通道的）响度电平。",
