    "text": "The top of the output button in the bottom bar is also highlighted in red. The Mix slider enables you to mix between the dry and processed signals, scaling the overall dynamic and static gain changes. Because the Mix slider ranges from 0% to 200%, you can also choose to increase overall gain processing instead of fading it out! Tips You can directly adjust the mix, input gain or output gain by clicking and dragging the button text vertically.",
